@startuml WF-03_Guest_Service_Request_Handling
title WF-03: Guest Service Request Handling (Feature F-03 | Scenarios DS-05, DS-06)\nProject: Intelligent Hotel Concierge Robot (HC-Robot) - FA26SE905 | Baseline: review-2

skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #334155
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #D97706
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #3B82F6
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 13
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #64748B

|Hotel Guest|
start
:Initiate service request via voice or touch menu\n(Room Service, Taxi Assistance, or Housekeeping);

|Concierge Robot|
:Prompt guest and collect required details\n(Room number / PIN verification, service items, or pickup notes);

|Hotel Guest|
:Provide service details and confirm submission;

|Concierge Robot|
:Validate input fields, classify service type,\nand create support request ticket;

if (Service request details valid?) then (No - Missing or invalid room/PIN/items)
  :Display validation error and prompt guest to correct details;
  |Hotel Guest|
  :Review validation message;
  stop
else (Yes - Valid service request)
  |Concierge Robot|
  :Persist newly created support request record;
  note right
    **Entity State Transition**
    BM01 Intended: SupportRequest.status = **NEW**
    (DB Implementation: status = **"Pending"**, progress = 0%)
  end note
endif

if (Target department available within operating hours?) then (No - DS-06: Department unavailable / Off-hours)
  |Concierge Robot|
  :Inform guest that department is currently off-hours\nand offer scheduled booking for next available shift;

  |Hotel Guest|
  if (Guest confirms scheduled booking for next shift?) then (Yes - Schedule request)
    :Confirm scheduled time slot;
    |Concierge Robot|
    :Queue request for next available department shift\nand display scheduled booking confirmation;
    note right
      **Exception Scenario DS-06 (Design vs DB Note)**
      BM01 Intended: SupportRequest.status = **SCHEDULED**
      DB Implementation: Stored as status = **"Pending"**
      with scheduled time in description/extra_data
      (No dedicated SCHEDULED enum in support_requests).
    end note
    |Hotel Guest|
    :Receive scheduled booking notification on screen;
    stop
  else (No - Cancel request)
    |Concierge Robot|
    :Cancel unsubmitted off-hours request and return to menu;
    stop
  endif

else (Yes - DS-05: Department available)
  |Concierge Robot|
  :Assign request to target department\nand broadcast real-time notification;
  note right
    **Entity State Transition**
    BM01 Intended: SupportRequest.status = **ASSIGNED**
    (DB Implementation: routed via department_id,
    Notification broadcast over WebSocket)
  end note

  |Department Staff|
  :Receive real-time request alert on Department Dashboard;

  if (Requires Head Lead dispatch override or SLA escalation (>5 min)?) then (Yes - Escalation or priority dispatch)
    |Head Lead|
    :Review unacknowledged or priority request,\nissue management directive, and assign/confirm staff;
  else (No - Standard department handling)
  endif

  |Department Staff|
  :Accept request and begin fulfilling service task\n(e.g., prepare F&B order, dispatch housekeeping, or book taxi);
  note right
    **Entity State Transition**
    BM01 Intended: SupportRequest.status = **IN_PROGRESS**
    (DB Implementation: status = **"In Progress"**,
    assigned_staff_name recorded, progress = 25%..85%)
  end note

  if (Requires Head Lead supervisor confirmation for completion?) then (Yes - Supervisor review required)
    |Head Lead|
    :Verify service fulfillment quality and confirm completion;
  else (No - Standard staff completion)
  endif

  |Department Staff|
  :Mark service request as completed;
  note right
    **Entity State Transition**
    BM01 Intended: SupportRequest.status = **COMPLETED**
    (DB Implementation: status = **"Completed"** / **"Delivered"**,
    progress = 100%)
  end note

  |Concierge Robot|
  :Receive status update and display completion notification;

  |Hotel Guest|
  :Receive real-time service completion notification;
  stop
endif

@enduml

